  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br />Hence, the solution is,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>"
